  "expected_facts": [
    "config.toml declares the agent role reviewer ([agents.reviewer]) with a description and the config_file agents/reviewer.toml whose developer_instructions define the role; the recording replays both files into CODEX_HOME",
    "The root thread spawns notes_review with agent_type reviewer and notes_scan without a role in one step (fork_turns none), then one wait_agent returns after both finished",
    "The notes_review child has agent_role reviewer in session_meta and the role instructions as a developer message; the notes_scan child has agent_role null",
    "Each child runs its echo command, which exits with 0 and prints its word; the SubagentStart hook of notes_review carries agent_type reviewer, that of notes_scan default"
  ],
